{
	title: 'Use decision models as independent classification workers',
	spec: 'OpenRouter models with decisions output take the custom system prompt as an ASON map of typed questions and only the current user input as state. Parse an ASON object directly or wrap plain text in { message }. Return the answers as ASON through normal subagent reporting. A leave-open subagent may start idle and take one queued item per turn. Show the Jev example and SPAWN, SEND and WAIT guidance only to parents with available decision models and tools.',
